174
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,400
<i>Aku juga akan memakai kesempatan ini</i>

175
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,920
<i>untuk mengungkapkan
rasa terima kasihku kepadamu.</i>

176
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,880
KAU

177
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,480
ANDA

178
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,280
"Kapan Anda punya waktu luang?

179
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,320
Jika tidak mengganggu,

180
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:32,280
