Formal sekali.

186
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,760
PANGGILAN MASUK DARI JIAXU

187
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,520
{\an8}JIAXU

188
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:34,960
Halo, Jiaxu.

189
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,920
Aku bisa akhir pekan depan,

190
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,800
