kapan punya waktu luang.

191
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:41,920
Tidak apa-apa.

192
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,360
Pokoknya ikuti saja waktumu.

193
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,080
Baiklah.

194
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,080
Selain itu,

195
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:50,640
