memperbaiki ponselmu.

196
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,040
Ponselku?

197
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,480
Kenapa memperbaiki ponselku?

198
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,520
Bukankah ponselmu rusak?

199
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,880
<i>Ponselku tidak rusak.</i>

200
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,640
Kupikir ponselmu rusak.

201
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,240
Pesanmu sangat formal.

202
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,720
<i>Kenapa begitu?</i>

203
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:10,560
<i>Sebelumnya kau tidak pernah
bersikap formal kepadaku.</i>

204
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,200
<i>Kata-katamu sangat formal.</i>

205
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,680
Aku ingat sekarang.

206
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,640
Apakah ini berarti

207
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,960
