208
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,440
Jiaxu.

209
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,320
Begini, ya.

210
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,840
Ayahku menasihatiku.

211
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:38,400
<i>Saat berbicara dengan orang
yang lebih tua lima tahun dariku,</i>

212
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,720
