213
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:42,000
Aku harus memakai kata "Anda".

214
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,600
<i>Jiaxu lebih tua lima tahun dariku,
meski suaramu terdengar muda,</i>

215
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:47,440
usia tidak bisa berbohong.

216
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,400
Kau memang sudah tidak muda lagi.

217
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:51,160
- Jadi...
<i>- Aku harus menutup telepon. Dah.</i>

218
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:52,880
Tunggu.

219
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,280
Halo?

220
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:02,080
Ada satu hal lagi
yang mau kuberi tahu padamu.

221
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:04,960
Ada apa?

222
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,640
